let __v_992 = Value::from("You can get plenty without meat: eggs, milk, cheese and yogurt, a tin of beans or chickpeas (about 15g of protein), lentils (about 18g per 100g dry), tofu, nuts, seeds and wholegrains. Spread it over the day rather than one meal - beans at lunch, eggs or tofu at dinner, yogurt and nuts as a snack - and there is no need to count anything.");
