let __v_1036 = Value::from("Chutney is fruit or veg with half its weight of sugar and enough vinegar to cover, simmered down until a spoon drawn across the pan leaves a trail - an hour or two - then potted in hot jars and left 3 to 4 weeks to mellow. The vinegar is what keeps it, so do not skimp on it.");
