let __v_1048 = Value::from("Rinse them quickly under the tap and dry them on a tea towel - mushrooms take on very little water in a few seconds, and a wipe with damp kitchen paper leaves the grit in the gills. Do not leave them soaking in a bowl, which is the one thing that does make them watery, and cook them straight after.");
