let __v_3914 = Value::from("In the freezer, about 3 months for most things before the quality drops: raw meat and fish, cooked dishes, soup, stock, bread, cake, cheese and butter. A whole bird or a joint goes 6 months, blanched veg and fruit 6 to 12, and ice cream 2 to 3. It stays safe long past that, just drier, so write the date on the bag. The fridge is much shorter: raw meat 1 to 2 days, cooked food 3 to 4.");
