let __v_3916 = Value::from("No honey at all before the first birthday: it can carry botulism spores that a baby's gut is too young to deal with, and heat does not destroy them, so cooked honey is out too. That covers honey in porridge, on a dummy or in a homemade cough remedy. From the first birthday it is fine, so a toddler or an older child can have it.");
