let __v_4560 = Value::from("With a hob you can still eat well: pasta with a sauce made in the pan, rice with stir-fried veg and an egg on top, a one-pan curry of chickpeas or lentils with tomatoes, quesadillas or toasted sandwiches pressed in a dry pan, or potatoes boiled and then crushed into a pan with butter and greens. Eggs, tinned fish and beans all cook in a pan in minutes.");
